<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-BELGIUM FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIUM FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Belgian first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Standard Liege 0     Genk	     2</p>
<p> Lokeren	  0     Mouscron	 2</p>
<p> Mechelen	 0     Antwerp	  0</p>
<p> Charleroi	1     Ghent	    0</p>
<p> Molenbeek	2     Sint Truiden   1</p>
<p>Lommel vs Anderlecht. Match postponed due to pitch condition.</p>
